    "Result": "The path of stones.Jack and Jane lived by the forest. Their father often said to them, never go into the forest. You may get lost. One day. Jack said to Jane, let's go into the forest and have a look. Jack and Jane went into the forest. They saw beautiful flowers and interesting insects. They were happy. After some time, they felt hungry and tired. Jane looked around. She could not find her way, she said to Jack Jack.We're lost. Don't worry. Look at the stones on the ground. I drop them on the way we can follow them back home, said Jack. Jack and Jane followed the stones back home. Their father was very happy to see them.",
